 "kind": "definition",
 "title": "Trace-class source",
 "statement": "In the setting of [def-trf-correspondence], for an admissible\ncohomological correspondence\n$u:Lc_2^*K\\to Rc_1^!K$ put\n\n$$\n\\mathcal H_c(K):=\nR\\mathcal Hom_A\\bigl(Lc_2^*K,Rc_1^!K\\bigr)\\in D(C,A).\n$$\n\nBy the tensor–internal-Hom\nadjunction, the correspondence $u$ is equivalently a section (the\n*mate*) $\\widetilde u:A_C\\to\\mathcal H_c(K)$, i.e. an element of\n$\\Hom_{D(C,A)}(A_C,\\mathcal H_c(K))$: the adjunction isomorphism\n\n$$\n\\Hom_{D(C,A)}(A_C,R\\mathcal Hom_A(Lc_2^*K,Rc_1^!K))\n\\cong\n\\Hom_{D(C,A)}(Lc_2^*K,Rc_1^!K)\n$$\n\nidentifies $\\widetilde u$ with $u$.",
 "source": {
